@startuml
title UI-01 configured sign-in and recovery — DRAFT
actor Human
participant "Angular Auth / Router" as UI
participant "Project Service\nsame-origin BFF" as API
participant "Configured identity provider" as IdP
Human -> UI : open protected deep link
UI -> API : GET auth/session
alt signed in
  API --> UI : identity
  UI -> API : authorize project/resource read
  API --> UI : authorized data or refusal
else no session / expired
  API --> UI : 401
  UI -> UI : mask protected content; sanitize return
  UI -> API : GET auth/config
  API --> UI : oidc or development password mode
  alt configured OIDC
    Human -> UI : Sign in again
    UI -> API : navigate configured login + safe return
    API -> IdP : server-owned OIDC handshake
    IdP --> API : callback
    API --> UI : session cookie + safe app return
  else development password mode
    Human -> UI : enter credentials
    UI -> API : POST auth/session + CSRF
    API --> UI : identity / safe error
  end
  UI -> UI : reset state if identity changed
  UI -> API : reauthorize return resource; reconcile known keys
  API --> UI : current state or refusal
  note right of UI : No automatic mutation replay.
end
@enduml
